    {
      "id": "17976584838120966",
      "caption": "🏆✨ A big congratulations to our Miami Qigong Performance Team, “A Million Dreamers,” for receiving the Rising Star Award at the 2nd National Qigong Competition at #BEFestival2026! ✨🏆\n\nOur performance carried a simple but powerful message: when we hold onto a dream and work together with one heart, we can make the impossible possible. 🌟\n\nA heartfelt thank you to every member of our team for your dedication, effort, and courage — especially for stepping onto the stage and performing in front of more than 300 people! ❤️‍🔥\n\nThrough this journey, we learned so much more than a performance. We learned how to work as one team, how to become more flexible in our minds and bodies, how to overcome challenges together, and how to express our hearts through a deeply emotional and touching performance. 🫶\n\nAnd a very special thank you to @bodynbrain.us for creating and hosting such an incredible event. 🙏✨ It was truly an unforgettable experience, and we grew so much through this opportunity.\n\nWe’re leaving with fuller hearts, stronger connections, and even bigger dreams. 💫\n\nWe already can’t wait to come back and participate again next year!\n\nA Million Dreamers — keep dreaming, keep growing, and keep making the impossible possible. 🌎✨\n\n#AMillionDreamers #BEFestival2026 #Qigong #Qigongcompetition",
      "media_type": "VIDEO",
      "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dc85YjpPzIx/",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-06T15:50:20+0000",
