      "comments_count": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "18182474227418815",
      "caption": "🌋✨ Day 1 of our Brain Education Festival in Sedona ✨🌋\n\nBefore arriving at @sedonamagoretreat, we began our journey together with a visit to one of Sedona’s most powerful vortex sites — Cathedral Rock. ❤️‍🔥\n\nWe trained together, hiked through the breathtaking red rocks, and took time to slow down, breathe, and reconnect with the Earth. 🌎✨\n\nSedona is a truly special place — a place where the spirit of the Earth feels alive and present. A place that invites you to remember who you are, reconnect with yourself, and ask deeper questions about life and the path you are walking. 🌿\n\nSo grateful for all of our beautiful members who had the courage and openness to step into this adventure together. 🤍\n\nThis is only Day 1… and the journey has just begun. ✨\n\n#BrainEducationFestival #Sedona #befestival2026",
